1. c4 e5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. g3 Bb4 4. Bg2 O-O 5. Nf3 (5. e4 {Korchnoi/Pfleger}) ({Instead of this rather tame move, White should play} 5. Nd5 {. As played, Black is allowed to assume the initiative - Golombek}) 5... Re8 6. O-O e4 7. Nd4 Bxc3 (7... Nc6 $1 8. Nc2 Bxc3 9. bxc3 d5 10. cxd5 Qxd5 $13 {(with the idea Qh5, Bh3) Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 8. bxc3 Nc6 9. d3 exd3 10. exd3 h6 (10... Nxd4 11. cxd4 d5 12. Bg5 h6 13. Bxf6 Qxf6 14. cxd5 Qxd4 $13 {Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 11. Re1 ({After} 11. Nxc6 dxc6 {Black has the advantage owing to his pressure along the open files, but better than the text-move is 11 Be3 - Golombek}) 11... Rxe1+ 12. Qxe1 Nxd4 13. cxd4 d5 14. Ba3 (14. Bf4 Be6 $14 {Korchnoi/Pfleger} (14... c6 15. Be5 Be6 $14) (14... dxc4 15. dxc4 Qxd4 $2 16. Rd1 $1 $18)) 14... Be6 15. Rb1 b6 16. Rc1 Qd7 17. Qd2 (17. Be7 $5 Qxe7 18. cxd5 Rd8 19. dxe6 Rxd4 20. exf7+ Qxf7 $17 {Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 17... Re8 18. c5 Bh3 19. cxb6 axb6 (19... cxb6 20. Qf4 {with the idea Bd6, Be5 - Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 20. Bb4 (20. Bxh3 $2 Qxh3 {with the idea Ng4 - Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 20... Nh7 21. Bxh3 (21. Qf4 Ng5 22. Rxc7 Qa4 23. Qd2 Ne6 {Korchnoi/Pfleger}) ({If} 21. Bh1 Ng5 {threatening Bg4 - Golombek}) 21... Qxh3 22. Rxc7 (22. Re1 Rxe1+ 23. Qxe1 Ng5 24. Qe2 Qf5 $17 {Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 22... Ng5 23. Qd1 (23. Qf4 Qh5 {with the idea Nh3+ - Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 23... Ne6 $17 24. Re7 (24. Rd7 Nf4 $19 {Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 24... Rc8 25. Bd2 Nxd4 26. Re3 (26. Be3 Nc6 27. Rb7 Ne5 28. f3 Rc2 29. Bf2 Rc1 $19 {Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 26... h5 27. Qa4 Qg4 28. Kg2 b5 (28... Nf3 29. Re8+ Rxe8 30. Qxe8+ Kh7 31. Qe2 $11 {Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 29. Qa6 Rc2 30. h3 Qf5 (30... Qg6) 31. Qa7 (31. Be1 Rc6 32. Qa8+ Kh7 33. Re8 Qf3+ {Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 31... Nc6 (31... Rxd2 32. Re8+ Kh7 33. Qxd4 Rxd3 34. Qf4 Qxf4 35. gxf4 $17 {Korchnoi/Pfleger}) 32. Qa8+ Kh7 33. Rf3 Qg6 34. Bf4 Nd4 35. Re3 Ne6 36. Rf3 (36. Bb8 d4 $19) 36... h4 37. Qxd5 $4 $138 (37. g4 Nxf4+ 38. Rxf4 Qxd3 39. Rf3 Qe4 $19) (37. Be3 d4 $19) (37. Be5 hxg3 38. Bxg3 Nd4 39. Rf4 Nf5 $19) (37. Qb8 $1 Rxa2 $17) 37... Nxf4+ {Sources: The Chess Player, 1972/2, p4; The Times, 8 January 1972 (Golombek); Informator 13/53 (Minic-Maric - which omits the final move 37...Nxf4+)} 0-1

